No money. No facilities. No guarantees.
And yet, Tejas Shirse kept showing up every morning, every fall, every finish line.

From a modest home in Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar to a National Record in 13.41 seconds, this is the story of a dream too stubborn to quit. “Chasing – A National Record” is more than a documentary - it’s a tribute to everyone who refuses to stop trying.

