What followed was not a comeback montage. It was years of recovery, discipline, and silent work behind closed gym doors.

From a small village in Tawang, Arunachal Pradesh, to competing as an MMA athlete on the national stage, Sonam Zomba’s journey reflects the reality of combat sports. Injuries, setbacks, pressure, and the choice to continue when stopping felt easier.

This documentary explores the fight beyond the cage and the mindset required to return stronger.

This is the story of an MMA athlete who refused to quit.
This is Sonam Zomba.

