42,000 burpee board jumps. 42 kilometers.
One relentless man rewriting the rules of endurance.

What started as a dream quickly turned into a battle between mind and muscle, body and belief.

Every rep dragged him closer to the edge. Every fall dared him to quit. But Mann didn’t come to a stop halfway. He came to prove that the impossible bends when will refuses to break.

This was more than a marathon.

It was pain stretched across 42 kilometers, every meter earned through grit, blood, and a promise he made to himself: to finish what no one ever began.
And when the dust settled, he did the unthinkable, completing a 42KM Burpee Marathon and etching his name into the world record books.

Watch every lap. Feel every muscle scream. 
Experience what happens when an impossible dream becomes history.

Stack your stock of 100% genuine supplements from: https://www.muscleblaze.com/

