Ankit Baiyanpuria - the man who sparked a national movement with his 75 Hard challenge - meets 6-year-old Adwik Paul, the (might we say adorable!) kid who's capturing hearts by training every day with his dad. Watch this heartwarming, yet powerful conversation unfold - a meeting of intent, discipline, and unshakable will.



