r premium quality product range to athletes, bodybuilders and fitness enthusiasts. An expert team of certified sport nutritionists and fitness professionals brought in years of experience to create a brand that offers a comprehensive range of bodybuilding supplements to you. Our young brand is proud to gain a wide acceptance with over 3 million customers."", ""channelJoinedDate"": ""Jan 1, 2014"", ""channelDescriptionLinks"": [{""text"": ""Website"", ""url"": ""http://www.muscleblaze.com""}, {""text"": ""Instagram"", ""url"": ""https://www.instagram.com/muscleblaze/""}, {""text"": ""Twitter"", ""url"": ""http://www.twitter.com/MuscleBlaze""}, {""text"": ""Facebook"", ""url"": ""http://www.facebook.com/MuscleBlaze""}, {""text"": ""LinkedIn"", ""url"": ""https://www.linkedin.com/company/muscleblaze/""}], ""channelLocation"": ""India"", ""channelUsername"": ""MuscleBlaze"", ""channelAvatarUrl"": ""https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/3rWUhxMH_AgcKnrtFZhZr2nD1_fBIBko8x1eYrkeE8noHJ0IDaMu3neJMq8ZN8xewDUL3Jdo=s68-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj"", ""channelBannerUrl"": ""https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/pwslaCDpj_u66KKfemkodO0rTw7bHGOWHyGEUWL1uwFtuqjOYgELGkr0KRNCAT8y3sOb6vJy=w2560-fcrop64=1,00005a57ffffa5a8-k-c0xffffffff-no-nd-rj"", ""channelTotalVideos"": 1184, ""channelTotalViews"": 587247578, ""numberOfSubscribers"": 1060000, ""isChannelVerified"": true, ""channelName"": ""MuscleBlaze"", ""channelUrl"": ""https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlSCO8Tnr1_QUSDNjWCwjA"", ""channelId"": ""UCKlSCO8Tnr1_QUSDNjWCwjA"", ""inputChannelUrl"": ""https://www.youtube.com/@MuscleBlaze"", ""isAgeRestricted"": false}",1:15:17,234,"What does it take to turn a name into a legacy? To push past pain, doubt, and every limit the
body dares to impose?
Sourav Singh Rajput aka Singha @FitMindsvlogs  —wasn’t always the powerhouse he is today. Before the
305KG deadlift, before the national record, before standing 5th at the 2023 Asian Powerlifting
Championship, there was just a guy with a hunger to be more.
In this episode of Beyond Zidd – The MuscleBlaze Podcast, Singha sits down with Kaustuv
Paliwal to pull back the curtain on his journey—the battles fought inside and outside the gym,
the rivalries that tested him, and the weight of expectations that come with strength. From the
pressure of social media to the raw, unfiltered realities of powerlifting, he lays it all on the table.
This isn’t just a conversation about lifting weights. It’s about lifting yourself past failure, past
expectations, past everything standing in your way.
Watch now and fuel your ZIDD.
Tell us in the comments—what’s the one challenge that made you stronger?


