This video follows Anmol Raina (hybrid) and Gokul Bijuraj (bodybuilder) as they push themselves through a full hurdles training routine and end it with the ultimate showdown: a head-to-head hurdles race.

Filmed during a late-night track session, this episode dives deep into what it actually takes to clear hurdles at a competitive level. From footwork drills to stride adjustments, every moment reveals how two very different athletes adapt to elite demands.

In this video, you'll find:

Olympian-level hurdles coaching by Tejas Shirse
Technique correction and drill-by-drill analysis
Hybrid athlete vs bodybuilder performance comparison
Real-time feedback, mistakes, progress, and learnings

If you're interested in hurdles training, hybrid athletic performance, bodybuilding mobility challenges, or elite track and field technique, this is a complete inside look into the process!

Tell us in the comments: Who did it the best?

