rtified sport nutritionists and fitness professionals brought in years of experience to create a brand that offers a comprehensive range of bodybuilding supplements to you. Our young brand is proud to gain a wide acceptance with over 3 million customers."", ""channelJoinedDate"": ""Jan 1, 2014"", ""channelDescriptionLinks"": [{""text"": ""Website"", ""url"": ""http://www.muscleblaze.com""}, {""text"": ""Instagram"", ""url"": ""https://www.instagram.com/muscleblaze/""}, {""text"": ""Twitter"", ""url"": ""http://www.twitter.com/MuscleBlaze""}, {""text"": ""Facebook"", ""url"": ""http://www.facebook.com/MuscleBlaze""}, {""text"": ""LinkedIn"", ""url"": ""https://www.linkedin.com/company/muscleblaze/""}], ""channelLocation"": ""India"", ""channelUsername"": ""MuscleBlaze"", ""channelAvatarUrl"": ""https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/3rWUhxMH_AgcKnrtFZhZr2nD1_fBIBko8x1eYrkeE8noHJ0IDaMu3neJMq8ZN8xewDUL3Jdo=s68-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj"", ""channelBannerUrl"": ""https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/pwslaCDpj_u66KKfemkodO0rTw7bHGOWHyGEUWL1uwFtuqjOYgELGkr0KRNCAT8y3sOb6vJy=w2560-fcrop64=1,00005a57ffffa5a8-k-c0xffffffff-no-nd-rj"", ""channelTotalVideos"": 1184, ""channelTotalViews"": 587247578, ""numberOfSubscribers"": 1060000, ""isChannelVerified"": true, ""channelName"": ""MuscleBlaze"", ""channelUrl"": ""https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlSCO8Tnr1_QUSDNjWCwjA"", ""channelId"": ""UCKlSCO8Tnr1_QUSDNjWCwjA"", ""inputChannelUrl"": ""https://www.youtube.com/@MuscleBlaze"", ""isAgeRestricted"": false}",0:12:17,29,"Meet Ria and Prashant - India's strongest HYROX couple - as they take on the brutal sub-60 challenge that has nothing to do with podiums and everything to do with who they are when no one's watching.

Ria lost her father at seven. Judo became her language of survival - 5 national golds, 13 national medals, and a knee injury that forced her to rebuild from zero. Prashant's own judo career left him broken, so he reinvented himself through CrossFit, becoming not just an athlete but a coach who rebuilds others the way he rebuilt himself.

They found each other already broken by the sport they loved. Now they push each other toward a standard neither one will lower — hunting a number with no crowd, no medal, and no finish line except the one they set for themselves.

This is what happens after you've already won.

🎬 Watch the full story unfold now.

