What happens when hybrid runners trade their comfort zones for the unforgiving world of combat sports?

In this high-stakes discipline swap, cardio meets combat, strength meets skill, and every punch, kick, and grapple pushes them to their limits. Joy and Krishbir quickly realize endurance alone isn’t enough against a trained MMA pro. Techniques are tested, confidence is challenged, and the fight becomes a battle for survival.

Can running prepare anyone for a real fight? Or does the cage reveal what endurance can’t? Watch to see who adapts, who struggles, and who makes it out alive.

