At just 24 years old, Parth has already built a remarkable career:
• Senior National Champion (2026)
• Junior National Champion (2025)
• Represented India at the IPF World Championships
• Holder of India's 770 kg Total National Record
• Holder of India's 332.5 kg Deadlift National Record
• Three consecutive National Record-breaking performances

But this story isn't about the numbers. It's about the pursuit behind them. 

In Pursuit Of is a documentary series by MuscleBlaze that explores the relentless journeys of India's finest athletes—the sacrifices, setbacks and mindset that shape greatness long before the podium.

In this episode, In Pursuit Of More, we follow Parth Mehta's journey from chasing strength to becoming one of the athletes redefining Indian powerlifting.

Because for those who are truly in pursuit, becoming number one is never the finish line.

It's simply the beginning.

#InPursuitOf #ParthMehta #Powerlifting #IndianPowerlifting #NationalChampion #NationalRecordHolder #StrengthSports #muscleblaze 


