In this latest episode of our Beyond Muscles Podcast series, our host Kaustuv Paliwal has an uncensored conversation with the famous @yourfitnesstories  aka Shivam Dubey, India’s funniest fitness creator!

Join us, as this exclusive interview dives deep into:

1. Earnings as a personal trainer, a reality check (and it might surprise you!)
2. Client confessions about abuse of steroids, caffeine & the (ugly) truth behind their hype
3. Sattu vs Whey Protein: The Great Indian Debate, settled, once and for all
4. Army brat to fitness content creator: Shivam's inspiring journey
5. Battling addiction & depression

It's raw, it's real, and it's packed with actionable knowledge!

Watch the full episode now, to level up your training, diet & nutrition for better results.

P.S. You can fuel your fitness journey with 100% genuine supplements on muscleblaze.com and the MB app.

