Join our host Kaustuv Paliwal as Col. Bharwan, a mentor to countless Army aspirants, shares his journey and wisdom. Discover his inspiring journey, his advice for young Indians, and the realities of military life.

This episode is a must-listen for anyone seeking motivation and a glimpse into the life of an extraordinary leader.

