In this latest episode of our Beyond Muscles Podcast series, our host Kaustuv Paliwal has an unfiltered and candid conversation with two of the most celebrated and respected fitness icons in the country - @Ankitbaiyanpuria  & @SaketGokhaleVlogs. 

Join us, as this exclusive interview dives deep into:

The fitness evolution so far, and where we’re headed
Ankit Baiyanpuria & Saket Gokhale’s workout and training protocols
The behind the scenes of the famous ‘Ankit Baiyanpuria 75-hard’ challenge
Short vs. long-form content on Social Media
‘No fap’ & Brahmacharya: Fact or fad
What does fitness truly mean for Ankit Baiyanpuria & Saket Gokhale

…And more raw, uncut knowledge from the OGs!

Watch the full episode now, to level up your training, diet & nutrition for better results.

P.S. You can fuel your fitness journey with 100% genuine supplements on muscleblaze.com and the MB app.

