In this latest episode of MuscleBlaze's Beyond Muscles podcast series, we have with us, India's arm-wrestling champion, and an Asian Games medallist - Rahul Panicker.

Software engineer by day, and a powerful arm-wrestling force by night, Rahul joins our hosts, Gagan Saini and Anubhav Jalta in this interview to share his humble journey with MuscleBlazes' Ziddis!

In this power-packed conversation, Rahul Panicker sheds light on:

- Navigating obstacles in a field that is considered niche, and paving the path to Nationals
- His training and workout methodologies for arm-wrestling
- The truth behind the 'Indian flag controversy' at the Asian Games
- His legendary super match with one of the world's strongest powerlifters and arm-wrestlers, Larry Wheels

Watch the full discussion for a journey of defeat, redemption and victory!

