In this latest episode of the Beyond Muscles podcast series, we have with us, a renowned Gastroenterologist and a holistic health advocate, Dr. Pal Manickam.

As he joins our host, Kaustuv Paliwal, the episode dives deep into the gut, revealing its surprising power over muscle strength, sex life, cognitive function, and overall well-being.

In this transformative interview, Dr. Pal sheds light on:

- Approaching weight loss through intermittent fasting
- The detrimental impact of alcohol consumption on gut health
- Major red flags about packaged food (and things we should avoid!)

And if you'd like to evaluate your gut health, here's the Bristol Stool Chart you can refer to (explained in extensive detail in the podcast!) - https://www.continence.org.au/bristol-stool-chart

Watch the discussion for actionable tips that can help you improve your gut health

Topics :

0:00 - 1:24: Teaser to the podcast
1:24 - 3:15: Dr. Pal’s journey to becoming ‘The Gut Guru’
3:16 - 4:35: Doctor by day, YouTube sensation by night
4:36 - 6:12: Brain, mood, even sex life? Here’s why you NEED this
6:13 - 10:55: Move over Marvel, our gut has its own heroes and villains! 
10:56 - 18:56: Behind every successful brain, there is a stomach!
18:57 - 23:30: How the gut controls your cravings (and your brain)
23:31 - 26:15: Feeling down? It might be your gut! 
26:16 - 31:57: Mental health, physical health, you name anything - it’s all in your gut!
31:58 - 33:38: Why good bacteria LOVE hydration
33:39 - 35:29: Why physical activity does not directly improve good bacteria
35:30 - 38:29: Gut microbiome is depleting like deforestation
38:30 - 42:37: ME time? More like MEAL time!
42:38 - 47:59: What your gut likes (and carbs are not the villain!)
48:00 - 51:31: Your gut impacts your sex life more than you think!
51:32 - 54:24: Can gut microbiome boost testosterone levels?
54:25 - 1:05:47: Why you should slowly introduce protein supps to your gut
1:05:48 - 1:07:29: Is any region’s diet better suited for the gut? 
1:09:22 - 1:10:26: The vegetarian VS non-vegetarian debate
1:10:27 - 1:13:13: Gut health and athletic performance
1:13:14 - 1:18:59: Bristol Stool Chart - How can you measure your gut health? 
1:19:00 - 1:21:21: Red flags to look out for in your diet
1:21:22 - 1:26:00: How anti-biotics destroy 50% of your gut bacteria!
1:26:01 - 1:30:20: Dr. Pal’s ZIDD moment
1:30:21 - 1:36:46: Dr. Pal’s passion for comedic content creation
1:36:47 - 1:41:11: Muscles are your best friend (after your gut!)

P.S. You can stack your stock of 100% genuine supplements from https://www.muscleblaze.com/","Beyond digestion with ‪@DrPal‬: Impact of Gut Health on Muscles, Sex & Brain #muscleblaze #podcast #guthealth 

