#phirseziddkar #workoutmotivation #mentalhealth 
@AbhishekYadavyt @SaketGokhaleVlogs @YashSharmaFitness @theyashanand @FitMindsvlogs @VarinderGhumanheman 

‘MAN UP’. It is amazing how a two-word term has made generations of men both weak and strong at the same time. Instead of dealing with their emotions, men have been conditioned to bury them instead. Bottling up feelings and moving on has become a stable part of these men’s lives. But what happens when it leads to a burnout and breakdown? What if the bottle is full to the brim? Masculinity doesn’t lie in masking what a man feels but rather the opposite. Men hurt, men cry, but men heal too. MuscleBlaze Men’s Mental Health campaign celebrates all the men who prioritize the champion mindset above all. MEN who acknowledge their stress and turn to Iron therapy when things go south. MEN who choose to believe that with their Zidd they can conquer the strongest storms. At the end of the day it’s okay to not be okay, as long as you don’t give up!",,,,,,80,FALSE,https://www.youtube.com/@MuscleBlaze/videos,,[],FALSE,https://www.youtube.com/@MuscleBlaze,videos,FALSE
