MuscleBlaze's first ever podcast explodes on the block with valuable insights of @Ankitbaiyanpuria   a true Ziddi who imbibes the same value as the brand of relentless consistency and unbreakable will to defy boundaries, watch to know it all!
From being somebody to becoming an inspiration for everybody, he took the fitness world by storm by completing what most wouldn't even dare to think about. The 75 Hard Challenge!! In this podcast he drops the truth bomb around the mental toughness, strict diet, workout split and everything that made him a 75 Hard internet sensation. 

Topics  - 

0:00-0:39 - Precap
0:40- 2:39 - Who is Ankit Baiyanpuria?
2:40- 6:59: What is Hard 75?
7:00- 8:29 : Workout split of Hard 75
8:30- 10:10: Why Bhagavad Gita?
10:11 - 12:09 : Challenges of Hard 75
