#phirseziddkar 

It takes courage to fight your demons. Talking about it takes even more. But those who do understand that being a MAN does not entail silently suffering until the battle pins you to the ground. Instead, it is about doing whatever it takes to find a solution, even if it means setting masculine pride aside and asking for help. You are not alone and all it takes is a voice to speak up.
Here is MuscleBlaze’s ultimate Ziddi, Vidyut Jammwal, serving as the beacon of light for all men struggling with mental health issues. Watch him talk unfiltered about the things that haunt him at times and the best ways to deal with them.

